    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The Reply-To for WP_Mail plugin allows you to easily manage the &#8220;Reply-To&#8221; header for all emails sent from your WordPress site. With this plugin, you can specify a custom email address that recipients will use when replying to your site&#8217;s emails, ensuring that responses go to the correct inbox.</p>\n<h3>Compatibility</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>WordPress: 4.1 &#8211; 6.7</li>\n<li>PHP: 5.6 &#8211; 8.4</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<h4>Manual download</h4>\n<p>Extract the contents of the ZIP and upload the contents to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/replyto/</code> directory. Once uploaded, it will appear in your plugin list.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>[1.0.2] &#8211; 2024-11-02</h4>\n<p><strong>Fixed</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Preparation for GlotPress.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.0.1] &#8211; 2024-10-31</h4>\n<p><strong>Added</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Translation ready.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>[1.0.0] &#8211; 2024-10-22</h4>\n<p><strong>Added</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>First version.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Configure the &quot;Reply-To&quot; header for WordPress emails with validation and customizable admin settings.",
